## 5. System Architecture & Surfaces

```mermaid
graph TD
    Client[Clients: Web / macOS / iOS / Mobile] --> Gateway[Caddy / Edge Gateway]
    Gateway --> WebApp[apps/web: Next.js App Router]
    Gateway --> ApiService[apps/api: NestJS Service]
    ApiService --> DB[(MongoDB / Postgres)]
    ApiService --> Cache[(Redis Cache / Queue)]
```

- **Surfaces**:
  - `apps/web`: Next.js (latest) App Router web application.
  - `apps/api`: NestJS backend API service on SWC.
  - `apps/macos` / `apps/ios` / `apps/mobile`: Native client applications.
  - `packages/design-tokens`: Shared design tokens with drift checking.

